 &lt;p class="eyebrow"&gt;Data Engineering · Analytics · Agentic AI&lt;/p&gt;

 &lt;h1 class="statement"&gt;I'm Johnny Li. I build the &lt;em&gt;data platforms&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em&gt;AI agents&lt;/em&gt; that turn billions of signals into decisions.&lt;/h1&gt;

 &lt;p class="bio"&gt;Data Engineer at Meta, working on measurement infrastructure for the monetization ecosystem. Before that: business intelligence in Amazon's finance org, and data analytics program management on Microsoft's Azure Sphere team. These days I think as much about AI agents and evaluation as I do about pipelines — this blog is where that thinking lands.&lt;/p&gt;

