&lt;h2 id="what-i-do"&gt;What I do
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="about-skills"&gt;
 &lt;div class="pillar pillar--data"&gt;
 &lt;canvas data-paint="grid" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/canvas&gt;
 &lt;h3&gt;Data Engineering&lt;/h3&gt;
 &lt;p&gt;Dimensional modeling, ETL/ELT architecture, distributed processing, data quality &amp;amp; governance.&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;div class="chips"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Spark&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Airflow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;dbt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Trino&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="pillar pillar--ai"&gt;
 &lt;canvas data-paint="scatter" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/canvas&gt;
 &lt;h3&gt;AI &amp;amp; Agents&lt;/h3&gt;
 &lt;p&gt;Agentic systems — tool use, task planning, memory — plus LLM evaluation and AI-assisted tooling.&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;div class="chips"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Tool use&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Planning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;LLM eval&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="pillar pillar--bi"&gt;
 &lt;canvas data-paint="wave" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/canvas&gt;
 &lt;h3&gt;Analytics &amp;amp; BI&lt;/h3&gt;
 &lt;p&gt;Metric standardization, semantic layers, funnel analytics and visualization people actually use.&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;div class="chips"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Tableau&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Power BI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Hex&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;D3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2 id="experience"&gt;Experience
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="about-exp"&gt;
 &lt;div class="col"&gt;
 &lt;div class="timeline"&gt;
 &lt;span class="time"&gt;2025 — Present&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;h3&gt;Data Engineer&lt;/h3&gt;
 &lt;p class="org"&gt;Meta · Signals Growth&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p class="scope"&gt;Measurement infrastructure for the monetization ecosystem — pipelines, attribution signals, and quality measurement for internal AI agents.&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="timeline is-past"&gt;
 &lt;span class="time"&gt;2021 — 2025&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;h3&gt;Business Intelligence Engineer&lt;/h3&gt;
 &lt;p class="org"&gt;Amazon · Store Finance Science&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p class="scope"&gt;Financial data models and ETL for procurement and P&amp;amp;L reporting, plus data-quality monitoring for forecasting.&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="timeline is-past"&gt;
 &lt;span class="time"&gt;2019 — 2021&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;h3&gt;Data Analytics Program Manager&lt;/h3&gt;
 &lt;p class="org"&gt;Microsoft Azure Sphere · via Pactera&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p class="scope"&gt;ETL pipelines and Power BI reporting for product health and customer support insight, and the report frameworks around them.&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="col"&gt;
 &lt;div class="timeline is-past"&gt;
