&lt;h2 id="now"&gt;Now
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="about-now"&gt;
 &lt;canvas data-paint="mesh" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/canvas&gt;
 &lt;span class="lbl"&gt;Now&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;ul&gt;
 &lt;li&gt;Building agentic systems that investigate and resolve pipeline issues on their own, and figuring out how to evaluate whether they actually work.&lt;/li&gt;
 &lt;li&gt;Running a home lab as a testbed for AI agents and data tooling outside a corporate environment.&lt;/li&gt;
 &lt;li&gt;Writing here about the decisions behind this work — what I chose, what I rejected, and what I'd do differently.&lt;/li&gt;
